This work builds on DigitalKhatt by Amine Anane, the Tanzil project, HarfBuzz, fontTools~\cite{fonttools}, quran-meta and Amiri. The page frame and surah header art comes from quran-assets by quran.ws (CC BY-NC-SA~4.0). The Madina Mushaf images are reproduced from the King Fahd Complex edition for analysis.
